MAIN STATE Horde NPC AI Rogue
    Events
        Time - Every 1.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue Not equal to No unit
        (NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue is hidden) Equal to False
        IsUnitAlive[(Custom value of NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue)] Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        -------- =================================== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue is in Companion_Group.) Not equal to True
                (Percentage life of NPC_Horde_AI_Rogue) Greater than or equal to (Random real number between 25.00 and 30.00)
